Package: ocm
Version: 0.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), easy-rsa, openssl, adduser
Recommends: openvpn
Maintainer: OCM Maintainers <ocm@example.com>
Description: OCM - OpenVPN Credential Manager
 Secure, minimal admin panel to issue and revoke OpenVPN client credentials.
 Bundles a NestJS API and a React web console.
 .
 OCM attaches to an OpenVPN server that is already installed and configured on
 this host: it issues clients from the existing easy-rsa CA and never creates a
 CA, a server certificate or a VPN instance of its own. The installer verifies
 the deployment and leaves its configuration, routing and firewall untouched.
 .
 The system starts with no administrator - create the first one with the
 ocm-admin CLI.
